# The rocket (spec M4c): pause.scenario's way into the race with the test game given a rocket
# (--save 0:FILE with the player's rocket at 1), then Up held from the start and the turbo
# (left Shift) with it for a second: the rocket's flame behind the car, its two pictures
# taking turns. A shot every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --watch.
